Z||000005||Wolfhound||09-03-2001||12:24 PM||||There are lost highways where almost no one goes anymore. Left behind by the interstates that carry the driven. They are my favorite.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rlt.JPG"> <BR>Examine closely the things you find along the way.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rlt2.JPG"> <BR>and the wild life below.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rlt3.JPG"> <BR>Find wonders few know of and visit in near seclusion.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rlt4.JPG"> <BR>and meet the exotic folk who watch over them.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rlt5.JPG"> <BR>Take your time!||||reg||1
